# Ab in roles ko kaise banayenge?

Har role ke liye main ye details dunga:

| No. | Kya milega? | Details |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Dashboard Overview | Cards, statistics aur KPIs |
| 2 | Complete Sidebar | Main menus aur submenus |
| 3 | Section-wise Features | Har section ke andar kya hoga |
| 4 | Tables & Columns | Listing mein kaunse fields honge |
| 5 | Buttons & Actions | Add, Edit, View, Assign, Approve, Print |
| 6 | Complete Workflow | Kaam shuru se end tak kaise chalega |
| 7 | Notifications | Alerts aur pending tasks |
| 8 | Permissions | User kya dekh aur kar sakta hai |
| 9 | Reports | Role-specific reports aur analytics |
| 10 | Quick Actions | Dashboard se directly hone wale kaam |

**Ek important baat:** Har role ko alag dashboard mil sakta hai, lekin chhote clinics mein ek employee ke paas multiple responsibilities ho sakti hain. Isliye software mein role-based permissions ke saath multiple roles assign karne ka option rakhna useful hoga.

Ab tu is master list mein se **kisi bhi number aur uske role ka naam** bata de. Hum us role ka complete dashboard blueprint ek-ek karke banayenge.